#: src/prefs.js:20
msgid "Disable all"
msgstr "全部排除"

#: src/prefs.js:21
msgid "Disable corners"
msgstr "排除圓角"

#: src/prefs.js:22
msgid "Disable shadow"
msgstr "排除陰影"

#: src/prefs.js:106 src/prefs.js:114
msgid "OK"
msgstr "確定"

#: src/prefs.js:126
msgid "General"
msgstr "一般"

#: src/prefs.js:133
msgid "Display & Rendering"
msgstr "顯示與渲染"

#: src/prefs.js:134
msgid "Control window decoration behavior across screen scales"
msgstr "控制視窗裝飾在不同螢幕縮放下的渲染行為"

#: src/prefs.js:139
msgid "Prioritize Crisp Text"
msgstr "優先保證文字清晰"

#: src/prefs.js:140
msgid ""
"Skip rounded corners on fractional scale monitors (retaining shadow) to "
"avoid text blur and resampling overhead"
msgstr ""
"在分數縮放螢幕上免除圓角（保留陰影），消除重新取樣帶來的字體模糊與效能損耗"

#: src/prefs.js:147
msgid "Inspect Window…"
msgstr "選取視窗…"

#: src/prefs.js:149
msgid ""
"Click an on-screen window to automatically detect and add exclusion rule"
msgstr "在螢幕上點選視窗以自動識別並新增排除規則"

#: src/prefs.js:153
msgid "Application Exclusion Rules"
msgstr "應用程式排除規則"

#: src/prefs.js:154
msgid ""
"Configure individual exclusions for specific windows (disable all, skip "
"corners, or skip shadow)"
msgstr "為特定視窗單獨設定排除項（全部停用、免除圓角或免除陰影）"

#: src/prefs.js:174
msgid "No Special Rules"
msgstr "尚無特殊規則"

#: src/prefs.js:175
msgid ""
"All normal windows without server-side decorations will have native shadow "
"and rounded corners applied by default"
msgstr "所有未包含伺服器端邊框的標準視窗預設將套用原生陰影與圓角裁切"

#: src/prefs.js:234
msgid "Remove Rule"
msgstr "刪除規則"

#: src/prefs.js:259
msgid "Window Inspection Failed"
msgstr "視窗選取失敗"

#: src/prefs.js:260
msgid ""
"Could not connect to CSD Fixer extension. Please ensure the extension is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"無法連線至 CSD Fixer 擴充套件，請確認該擴充套件已在 GNOME 擴充套件中啟用。"

#: src/prefs.js:275
#, javascript-format
msgid "Rule for \"%s\" already exists"
msgstr "「%s」的規則已存在"

#: src/prefs.js:286
#, javascript-format
msgid "Added rule for \"%s\""
msgstr "已為「%s」新增排除規則"
